---
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  jsonLd?: unknown;
}
const { title, description, jsonLd } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR" />
    {jsonLd && (
      <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
    )}
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="/" class="brand">잘버려</a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <slot />
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p>
        배출 기준은 지자체 조례에 따라 다를 수 있습니다.
        각 페이지에 근거 출처와 확인 날짜를 표시합니다.
      </p>
    </footer>
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #fff;
        --fg: #1a1a1a;
        --muted: #666;
        --line: #e5e5e5;
        --accent: #1b7f4b;
        --warn: #b3261e;
        --soft: #f6f7f6;
        color-scheme: light dark;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --bg: #16181a; --fg: #e9eaea; --muted: #9aa0a6;
          --line: #2c2f33; --soft: #1e2124;
          --accent: #4ec27f; --warn: #f28e88;
        }
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
        font: 16px/1.75 system-ui, -apple-system, "Apple SD Gothic Neo",
              "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
        word-break: keep-all;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }
      header, main, footer { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.15rem; }
      header { padding-top: 1.1rem; padding-bottom: 1.1rem; }
      .brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--fg); text-decoration: none; }
      footer {
        margin-top: 3.5rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem;
      }
      h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.35; margin: .4rem 0 1.1rem; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 2.2rem 0 .7rem; }
      a { color: var(--accent); }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
